Hi, I'm Kelsey! I am a mixed-methods researcher working at the intersection of sociology and computer science.

I study how communities construct norms and enforce boundaries. I've done this ethnographically and now computationally! I work with qualitative methods, statistical modeling, NLP, sentiment analysis, topic modeling, and machine learning in R.

I'm finishing an MS in Computational Social Science at Northeastern and currently am working on a paper about norm enforcement in online subcultures. More on that soon! 

If you'd like to collaborate or just talk research: [kelbrown017@gmail.com](mailto:kelbrown017@gmail.com)

